Ultimate Albedo possesses high intelligence, even greater than his devolved form. Because of his evolved intelligence, Ultimate Albedo can predict multiple scenarios and plan for each one.<ref name="FaFBM">''[[For a Few Brains More]]''</ref>

Ultimate Albedo can fire a powerful energy beam from his third eye. These beams are powerful enough to defeat [[Eye Guy]], Perk [[Upchuck]], and [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]] in one shot.<ref>''[[A Fistful of Brains]]''</ref>

Ultimate Albedo is capable of making forcefields.<ref name="MG"/> He can also send out pulse waves of energy capable of pushing objects or opponents away.<ref name="FaFBM"/>

===Equipment===
Using his hovercraft, Ultimate Albedo can fly.

When Ultimate Albedo absorbed [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]'s brain, he gained Azmuth's heightened level of intelligence and was eventually able to perceive the existence of the [[Multiverse|Omniverse]] and his place in it.<ref name="FaFBM"/>

In addition to increased intelligence, absorbing Azmuth's brain also gave Ultimate Albedo a finer control of his existing abilities while also gaining telekinesis and the ability to create energy spheres that could trap opponents.<ref name="FaFBM"/>

==Weaknesses==
Due to the size of his head in comparison to his limbs, Ultimate Albedo is completely dependent on his hovercraft for supporting himself.

Despite Ultimate Albedo's increased brainpower, he still does not think things through enough, something that Azmuth himself warned him about. He was completely overwhelmed by Azmuth's added intelligence, thereby making him indecisive and second-guess himself. This further proves that, even with his hyper-evolved brain, Ultimate Albedo still is not as smart as Azmuth.<ref name="FaFBM" />

==History==
*Ultimate Albedo first appeared in ''[[The Ultimate Heist]]'', where he demonstrated his completed [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] to [[Khyber]].
*In ''[[A Fistful of Brains]]'', Ultimate Albedo defeated [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] as [[Eye Guy]], Perk [[Upchuck]] and [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]] before switching into [[Ultimate Spidermonkey]].
*In ''[[For a Few Brains More]]'', Ultimate Albedo appeared four times. Firstly, he retrieved [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]'s brain. Then, he was defeated by [[Gravattack]] before switching into Negative [[Armodrillo]]. Later, he absorbed Azmuth's brain. Lastly, he appeared when reverting.
*In ''[[Malgax Attacks]]'', Ultimate Albedo announced to the [[Galvan (Classic)|Galvan]] masses on [[Galvan Prime (Classic)|Galvan Prime]] that he has achieved hyper-evolution and will soon rule over them.

