==Trivia==
*Unlike most [[Ultimate Forms]], Ultimate Albedo lacks the spikes protruding from his [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] symbol.
*Ultimate Albedo's limbs appear to have grown larger in each appearance.
*In ''[[Malgax Attacks]]'', Ultimate Albedo's hovercraft can be seen emitting red energy seen as rings.
*The subtitles refer to Ultimate Albedo as "Ultimate [[Grey Matter (Classic)|Grey Matter]]".
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] came up with and designed Ultimate Albedo.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Albedo was Derrick's idea.PNG]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's work on the Ultimate forms.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Ultimate Albedo's appearance is very similar to, and clearly inspired by, [[w:c:marvel:George_Tarleton_(Earth-616)|MODOK]] from [[Wikipedia:Marvel Comics|Marvel Comics]].

